<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92273" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεῖα</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέα, ῥᾶ</span> (qq. v.),
		(sts. elided, <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			15.356
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			17.273
		</span></i>), Adv. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾴδιος</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easily, lightly</i>, freq.
			in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (v. infr.) and <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				<u>Op.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, al., but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέα</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοὶ ῥεῖα ζώοντες</span> the
			gods who live <i>at ease</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.805
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτοισιν μὲν ταῦτα μέλει,
				κίθαρις καὶ ἀοιδή, ῥεῖα</span>
			<i>lightly, pleasantly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.160
			</span></i>; strengthd. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεῖα μάλ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.381
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				15.362
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ῥεῖα κυβιστᾷ</span>
			<i>easily, deftly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.745
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				749
			</span></i>.</div>
